ntional solver/verification method is background, never by itself a reason for 0. COLD START: an empty library or missing review history is NEVER sufficient for 1 and is not itself a reason for 0; ground a hypothesis in current task structure, candidate steps and reasonably obtainable evidence. For 1, claim states one concise potential reusable mechanism and the future decision it could change. Basis explains its task-structural grounds and, when relevant history contributes, the shared mathematical or operational relationship, together with current knowledge coverage. Keep verification_conditions:[{condition: text, check_basis: text}] to the minimum feasible check that could support, refine or challenge that mechanism in this run. Reuse self-check evidence: no default full re-solve, large experiment or extra execution branch. Affordable small-scale enumeration, original-versus-reduced-method comparison or targeted reproduction is allowed. Use applies_to for future premises and expected_changes only for meaningful metrics in their original units. For 0 give the candidate-specific reason in basis and OMIT claim. A 1 ALWAYS causes one review after a bound real attempt, including failures or unfinished checks; 0 skips induction. Record checks and learning in the factual receipt without changing the frozen switch. A refuted hypothesis may yield a useful boundary rule. Never substitute legacy expected/none/insufficient_basis for decision. Missing/illegal decision schedules 0 with a separate diagnostic.
